# 本地开发计划与代理交接文档：含本机绝对路径与开发过程叙述，不进公开仓库。
# Local development plans and agent hand-off documents: they carry absolute local paths and development-process narration, so they stay out of the
# public repository. 与上面已忽略的 /docs/ai-development/ 同一处置。
/docs/superpowers/

# 构建与测试产物：即使将来产物目录改名（TestResults/、binlog、日志、打包文件）也不会被误提交。
# Build and test output: even if those output folders are renamed later (TestResults/, binlogs, logs, archives) they can never be committed by accident.
TestResults/
*.trx
*.binlog
*.log
*.zip
